- **P1 tip.** origin develop `f6669623ccae5ab445be6e0e73fb4f19ae2c89d1`, read 10:14 AEST 2026-09-18, read verbs only.
- **P2 the file at the tip.** `redis.ts` blob `47659ee9c`, 732 lines (`wc -l`). `:683`'s text occurs **TWICE** in the file (`:350` and `:683`) — which is why this `## Where` is LINE-KEYED and why the trailing context is `:684`/`:685`. `    notificationSettingsStore.set(key, data);` occurs exactly ONCE (counted), so the hunk cannot land at 350. Lines 660-700 contain no non-ASCII character and none of the four hunk lines is blank.
- **P3 the gap.** #1035 tier-1 gate finding N-A, read at develop `34cdcfb26`, re-read at this tip and unchanged. `TTL.privacy` has five call sites (`:350`, `:383`, `:409`, `:434`, `:683`); only `:683` is touched.
