- **P5 no existing cell is disturbed.** Every existing test that mentions `setNotificationSettings`/`getNotificationSettings` supplies its own stub of the redis module (`vi.mock('../services/redis', …)` or an injected dep object) — none drives the real `setNotificationSettings`, so none can see this change. The new file's `vi.mock('ioredis')` and the module state `initRedis()` sets are file-scoped: `vitest.config.ts` sets no `isolate: false` and no pool override, so each test file gets its own module registry. A6 should read 565 -> 568 with 0 new reds.
